 "html": "<div style=\"text-align:left; color:#000; \"><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Laboratorium komputer ini terletak di lantai 2 Gedung D Fakultas Teknik. Ruangan ini dilengkapi dengan sejumlah unit komputer yang disusun rapi untuk menunjang kegiatan praktikum mahasiswa. Fasilitas di laboratorium ini mencakup AC, proyektor, papan tulis, serta jaringan listrik dan internet yang tertata baik untuk kenyamanan belajar.</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Mata kuliah yang diampu di laboratorium ini antara lain:</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Desain dan Analisis Algoritma</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Grafik Komputer</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Pemrograman Berbasis Komponen</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Basis Data Grafik</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Statistik dan Probabilitas Informatika</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Pemrograman Berorientasi Objek</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Elektronika Digital</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Teknologi yang Dapat Dikenakan</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Laboratorium ini menjadi pusat pengembangan keterampilan praktis mahasiswa dalam bidang algoritma, pemrograman, grafis komputer, serta penerapan teknologi modern.</SPAN></SPAN></DIV></div>",
