 "backgroundOpacity": 0,
 "html": "<div style=\"text-align:left; color:#000; \"><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Laboratorium Jaringan Komputer (Labor Jarkom) terletak di lantai 2 Gedung C Fakultas Teknik Informatika. Laboratorium ini dirancang untuk mendukung kegiatan praktikum mahasiswa dalam bidang jaringan komputer, arsitektur komputer, serta teknologi basis data dan komunikasi.</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Ruang laboratorium ini dilengkapi dengan deretan komputer yang modern, jaringan lokal (LAN) yang tertata rapi, proyektor, serta papan tulis untuk menunjang kegiatan pembelajaran praktis dan presentasi materi. Dengan suasana yang kondusif dan fasilitas yang lengkap, Labor Jarkom menjadi tempat ideal bagi mahasiswa untuk mengasah keterampilan teknis dan memperdalam pemahaman teoritis.</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Mata kuliah yang dilaksanakan di Labor Jarkom meliputi:</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Organisasi dan Arsitektur Komputer</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Switching, Routing and Wireless Essentials</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Jaringan Komputer</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Basis Data Grafik</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Pemrograman Berbasis Komponen</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Elektronika Digital</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Jaringan Perusahaan, Keamanan dan Otomasi</SPAN></SPAN></DIV><p STYLE=\"margin:0; line-height:12px;\"><BR STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"/></p><DIV STYLE=\"text-align:center;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"letter-spacing:0px;color:#000000;font-size:12px;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><SPAN STYLE=\"font-family:'Arial Black', Gadget, sans-serif;\">Sistem Komunikasi dan Telekomunikasi Data</SPAN></SPAN></DIV></div>",
